OL,3,GNEWSAGP service opens after six-month
OL,4,Adelay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new GP service to support thousands
OL,7,Fof new homes has opened following a
OL,8,Fsix-month delay.
OL,10,FThe #11m Magna Medical Centre in
OL,11,FRackheath, near Norwich, opened earlier
OL,12,Fthis year, but the GP practice was
OL,13,Fdelayed due to negotiations between NHS
OL,14,FProperty Services and Hoveton & Wroxham
OL,15,FMedical Practice, which will run the
OL,16,Fservice.
OL,18,FThe medical centre has been built to
OL,19,Fserve the growing village, where 4,000
OL,20,Fhomes are due to be built on a former
OL,21,Fairbase.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
