OL,3,GNEWSAGP service opens after six-month
OL,4,Adelay
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Murrell, Conservative district
OL,7,Fcouncillor for Wroxham, said "years of
OL,8,Fcampaigning" had helped deliver the new
OL,9,Ffacility. People could now register for
OL,10,Fthe GP service.
